<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DAOU Systems upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DAOU Systems upped.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co analyst Michael Samols Thursday raised estimates for DAOU Systems Inc to account for DAOU's acquisition of Integrex.</p>
<p>-- boosted his 1997 earnings estimate to $0.09 a share from $0.05 and 1998 to $0.57 a share from $0.43</p>
<p>-- raised the 1998 revenue estimate by 30 percent to $68.7 million.</p>
<p>-- DAOU shares were off 5/8 at 21-5/8 at mid-afternoon.</p>
</text>
